body_text:
Bumps github.com/expr-lang/expr from 1.17.5 to 1.17.6.

Release notes
Sourced from github.com/expr-lang/expr's releases.

V1.17.6
What's Changed

Improve parser and lexer by @​diegommm in expr-lang/expr#811
Ignoring fields with struct tag expr:"-" and make "in" return false for unexported fields by @​diegommm in expr-lang/expr#806
Fix runtime error not allowing to slice unaddressable array type by @​diegommm in expr-lang/expr#803
Fix *vm.VM memory leak by @​diegommm in expr-lang/expr#813




Commits

87df783 Update README.md (#815)
1128642 fix VM not clearing memory references when reused (#813)
f1c65fa Fix runtime error not allowing to slice unaddressable array type (#803)
85d0be8 Ignoring fields with struct tag expr:"-" and make "in" return false for unexp...
98b0990 Improve parser and lexer (#811)
See full diff in compare view




